{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "1bcb6ae623fc63fbfedeb6a562138b74445597e38a3ff2e05aca4ba8e083d326", "ja": "14歳の番組出演", "zh": "14岁的节目演出", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d7d252e1d4352c6fccf2c1607a351ff51924a56b44fb4eb3059ce758782e6efd", "ja": "動物番組にゲスト出演した可奈とやよい。\n動物にアフレコする企画では息ぴったりの\n共演を見せる。百獣の王ライオン役は大人の\n女優さんが勤めたけれど、仕事は成功したし\nきっと少しずつ大人に近づいているはず…？", "zh": "作为嘉宾出演动物节目的可奈和弥生。\n在为动物配音的企划中，两人展现了默契十足的\n合作。百兽之王狮子的角色由成年女演员担任，不过\n工作很成功，肯定也在一点点接近大人了……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "273e823fae7da2dde6022d5e999aa2c3383755f8f833e8ffa34da595d6152a4f", "ja": "（今日は可奈の仕事の日。何度かゲストに\n呼ばれている動物番組に出演する）", "zh": "（今天是可奈的工作日。她要出演那个已经邀请过她好几次的动物节目）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "67da5d7bbba91c3e29061acf9d1fa8da70fa0a815cdad43538cd8319ff4fddeb", "ja": "デュオ公演の撮影はこの収録の後だから、\nやよいはスタジオに現地集合でもよかったんだぞ？", "zh": "双人演出的拍摄在这次录制之后，所以弥生直接到摄影棚集合也没关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "7c4552e6cca03de2f16a7df05b4acb0c43fb966834d78e0dc21619ae78745dc7", "ja": "大丈夫です！　この間は可奈ちゃんが私のお仕事に\n付き添ってくれたから、今度は私の番かなーって。", "zh": "没关系的！前阵子可奈陪我一起去工作了，\n所以这次该轮到我啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "2b0e29d59c73c567074b562bfc09fa4edc6843d42680eabe5c331f2acc9ec7e4", "ja": "それに私、この番組好きなんです。\n外国の動物がたくさん出てきて面白いですよね！", "zh": "而且我很喜欢这个节目。会出现好多外国的动物，很有意思对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5181f0456956b34ae97c9f6cba9bda12677bde8b909ea1c8acccd49ab4292622", "ja": "わかった、それならここで俺と見学だな。\n……お、次は動物の映像に声をあてるコーナーだ。", "zh": "明白了，那就和我一起在这里参观吧。\n……哦，接下来是给动物影像配音的环节。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6fd5e29bb1ad4810226c08fddbbe3f3826f56e50f978953091780c7453389f6b", "ja": "可奈はハイエナの役をやるみたいだな。\n演技力のおかげで仕事の幅も広がっているな……。", "zh": "可奈好像要配鬣狗的角色啊。\n多亏了演技提升，接工作的范围也变宽了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "98fecc289fb8336079e6b66161686d0fedaff382c0939292c130c4a0643528ec", "ja": "はい。可奈ちゃん、お芝居すっごく上手に\nなってて……私も見て勉強しよーっと！", "zh": "好的。可奈的演技已经变得特别棒了……\n我也要好好看着学习一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1007_narration", "source_sha256": "d782d4d768e3a2f4bdd605b417c8ebd57f905def7667544fffacc6084f8a17b0", "ja": "ハイエナは獲物を横取りする動物と思われがち\nですが、自分で狩りもこなせる動物です。", "zh": "人们常常认为鬣狗是会抢夺猎物的动物，\n但其实它们也能自己捕猎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1008_narration", "source_sha256": "eb59259e418a5fd9c344bb9799d8fd3bb67fd1071f178cb1112e0a7cfbf1a5c6", "ja": "ネズミが餌を探しに歩いているところを、\nハイエナが狙っています。", "zh": "老鼠正在寻找食物，鬣狗正伺机捕猎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "fca0b22e958aa43bd536dc72e2774f6695b671de6599c93dba2da6c85bb2170b", "ja": "小さなネズミさん……♪\nそんなところにひとりでいたら……私の餌食だよ！", "zh": "小老鼠呀小老鼠……♪\n一个人待在这种地方……就要变成我的猎物啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "629313341e8151b5c2d5d7d7e42fc6809f11ee7d39977fc39ced40136b3fc049", "ja": "はわわーっ！？", "zh": "呀哇——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e7e24fa4911bf08d7ec92113956d30433373a665b0405e01aeadc4655dce1c92", "ja": "や、やよい。\n収録中だから静かにな……。", "zh": "弥、弥生。\n还在录音呢，小声点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "01716e60bb50ac72bad9fbc9b7fffa590000ae7183d84b0c4ab0c242f14f70a5", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい！\n驚いちゃって、つい……。", "zh": "对、对不起！\n因为吓了一跳，不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1013_unknown2", "source_sha256": "a8ba6ac7c0035919fb7ce2f7578681268689768a6e8ba4e6e977cd4f8bb191ac", "ja": "……。あの、そちらは765プロの\n高槻やよいさんで間違いないでしょうか……？", "zh": "……。请问，您就是765事务所的高槻弥生吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "41318119b62d1f054ba67422ac13c2149f235e03799c0c531782652c616ec984", "ja": "は、はい、ごめんなさい。\n大きな声を出しちゃって……。", "zh": "是、是的，对不起。\n不小心喊得太大声了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1015_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "37d53dae98adb5eb0521e6f181b5e4b7d17641dcc1990b2bbfd26487915c9a00", "ja": "いえいえ。あの、私この番組の\nディレクターなのですが……。", "zh": "哪里哪里。那个，我是这个节目的\n导演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1016_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "64ac3d8ef8b39e2de9d859a2f6a05b07a44a7c04b27abf73a4bd8038d6bfddd3", "ja": "もしよかったら、高槻やよいさんも\nゲスト参加いただけたりとかは……？", "zh": "如果可以的话，高槻弥生先生也能作为嘉宾参加吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "a334e671a588ce8c9705ecd65f8fc7a5e928af8e67ad66278cd9f4f2f1fe2f55", "ja": "えっ！？\n……あの、{$P$}……。", "zh": "诶！？\n……那个，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "54f1ade1df7bed7aae4d04c418ef59518434db6253bce66d55acfba05ecef846", "ja": "動物にアフレコするコーナーに、\nやよいも出演、ですか？", "zh": "要出演给动物配音的环节，弥生也要参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1019_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "78a5ea63a5d3068f0d324011b302f0c688312cf2061e84b235cc86efa627162a", "ja": "はい！　今の悲鳴、臨場感があり素晴らしく……\nぜひネズミ役で出演というのは……。", "zh": "好！刚才那声惨叫，临场感十足，真是太棒了……不如请你出演老鼠一角……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "287b84cfcb9feeb3e6e842c166f88605e45a5de2aa3d96f8a4dfab83c6847bb1", "ja": "……可奈ちゃんと、お芝居……。\n私、やってみたいです！", "zh": "……和可奈一起演戏……\n我想试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "dd1e1716c98071085d8196ffe4a730d89a575a40b0a3cbfb42fda716edd29c7e", "ja": "やよいはやる気みたいだな……。\nわかりました、それなら……。", "zh": "看来弥生很有干劲啊……\n我明白了，既然这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1022_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "fca0b22e958aa43bd536dc72e2774f6695b671de6599c93dba2da6c85bb2170b", "ja": "小さなネズミさん……♪\nそんなところにひとりでいたら……私の餌食だよ！", "zh": "小老鼠呀小老鼠……♪\n一个人待在这种地方……就要变成我的猎物啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "ceb9f82c5742c6be8f6ff99c0624b0b793b83860c1b3c22fba6b6ec32db8b32c", "ja": "はわわーっ！？\n誰か、助けてー！", "zh": "哇哇——！？\n谁来救救我——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "93037189368939dc07680dfa21b792e91b4bd4b4bbd9443fb8b7c2a97a2da16b", "ja": "無駄無駄！　ハイエナは狩りもできる俊足なの！\n逃げられるとでも……って、あれ……ここは……？", "zh": "没用没用！鬣狗可是连狩猎都能做到的飞毛腿！你以为能逃得掉吗……咦，等等……这里是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1026_daijyoyuuennjiruraion", "source_sha256": "fdbad46396c2d7afd7f2f9e3dc9c5e7fbfde756ebcddad7f11e39ca6203a3439", "ja": "おや、私の庭に小娘が2匹……。\nちょうどいい、おやつにしてやろうかねぇ！！", "zh": "哎呀，我的庭院里居然有2个小丫头……  \n正好，要不要把你们做成点心啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "22e4fa3f4463176bd2ce31d33f2c08da98de8af93acb13b38fb3efa9de917e14", "ja": "し、失礼しましたー！", "zh": "打、打扰了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "22e4fa3f4463176bd2ce31d33f2c08da98de8af93acb13b38fb3efa9de917e14", "ja": "し、失礼しましたー！", "zh": "打、打扰了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1029_null", "source_sha256": "4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4", "ja": "収録後……", "zh": "录音结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "da96136dd0a9a24e43d9ea252fe41238e900033b3f69d6d6ef60557389902734", "ja": "うん。二人の演技も噛み合っていて、\n突発だったけどいい仕事になったと思う。", "zh": "嗯。你们两人的演技也配合得很好，虽然是临时起意，但我觉得这次合作很成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "c84465b20b1efdbd973a062602bf4552627415a75bce4ff60f3296ea3da53184", "ja": "はい！　私も共演できて嬉しかったです！\nやよいちゃん、気合い入ってたね？", "zh": "是的！我也很高兴能一起演出！弥生很有干劲呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1032_005yay", "source_sha256": "6e2d2452ced10d17aa154d684633c85986b0b0c63f685f12c4a214eda5ac8ebc", "ja": "うん。可奈ちゃんのハイエナの演技、\nいつもより大人っぽかったでしょ？", "zh": "嗯。可奈演的鬣狗，\n比平时要更成熟对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "f548c086c1e684a2ed3044020491588f6a2e53506a00770deaf6aab9f0e9c5dc", "ja": "私、勉強してみたくって！　可奈ちゃんと\n一緒にお芝居したら、なにか掴めるかなーって！", "zh": "我想试着学习一下！和可奈一起演戏的话，说不定能领悟到什么呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "6003ea2be57a897168155bb96f7d97e3ad2bc05f257cf0da6968b254e314335e", "ja": "なるほど。\n積極的なのはそういうことだったのか。", "zh": "原来如此。\n你之所以这么积极，是因为这个啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1035_036kan", "source_sha256": "0fcb58589c8c5e4980f06d4427186b48ce2b0a1454c74b789ef956992bfdb787", "ja": "それならもっといいところ見せたかったけど……\n私も最後はライオンに敵わなかったから……。", "zh": "既然这样，我本来还想表现得更好一点，可是……我最后也还是敌不过狮子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "9f3b058630a27d2e59a7cb3180fa2b76965929c2d09710e5e2c2d42bd85d7ec3", "ja": "ああいう配役ってことは、たぶん、\n私ってまだまだ大人じゃないってことなのかも……。", "zh": "那样的角色安排，或许说明我还远远算不上成熟吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1037_005yay", "source_sha256": "126ac4f409339147118c98b27c995825f6425f985c95335a688d5468602bf1d4", "ja": "そっかぁ。一番大人なのは、\nあのライオン役の女優さんだったもんね。", "zh": "这样啊。最成熟的确实是饰演那头狮子的演员呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1038_005yay", "source_sha256": "626a88b20cfa18a7dcbe8c173b608618ca1c28c934b316e2e638c51070271d23", "ja": "大人への道って、まだまだ長いのかなぁ……。", "zh": "成为大人的道路，原来还很漫长吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "6dec9edac3932f0a4c3994adad53608da581c14db1b373214357b20d89852ab3", "ja": "でも、大丈夫！　公演まで時間はあるし、\nお仕事はうまくいったんだから！", "zh": "不过，没关系！距离公演还有时间，而且工作也顺利完成了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1040_005yay", "source_sha256": "0fea91b4e8f855b9e1ef4167490d59c47feabcc2544c9149b297032146edef32", "ja": "そう、だよね……！　明日からも\n素敵な大人目指して、がんばろー！", "zh": "对，说得没错……！从明天开始也要以成为出色的大人为目标，加油——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0376_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_03_1041_005yay", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
